Built on PdfCraft (https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft), MIT OR Apache-2.0, which supplies the PDF
reading, rendering, annotation and page-organising crates InkPDF uses, and the patched copies of
third-party crates (hayro, lopdf, vello_common) and the winit fork it pins. Those are fetched from their
own repositories at the commits named in Cargo.toml; none of their source is copied into this one. The
ArtCraft name and logos belong to the ArtCraft team and are not used here.

Assets: every icon (apps/inkpdf/icons/*.tex and the SVG drawn from them) and the application icon
(apps/inkpdf/installer/app-icon.tex) was drawn for this project. No font file is bundled: typed text uses
the Arial installed with Windows, read from the system at run time.